<title>JAPAN: NTT, Telekom Malaysia in joint venture.</title>
<headline>NTT, Telekom Malaysia in joint venture.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nippon Telegraph and Telephone Corp and Malaysia's Telekom Malaysia Bhd have agreed to form a joint venture in Malaysia involving intelligent building systems, NTT announced on Saturday.</p>
<p>The new company would be established at the end of June with a capitalisation of 11 million Malaysian ringgit, or about 550 million yen, NTT said in a statement.</p>
<p>NTT would aquire a 30 percent stake in the new firm, NTT said.</p>
